SUMMARY:Wood and Crook: Wooden Crook
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Rosie Wood and Jude Crook have had the absolute nerve to make t
 heir Edinburgh Fringe debut. This 50 minutes of classic scrapes and alterna
 tive stand-up is the split bill of the century. Working\, thinking\, modell
 ing – they have done it all! Rosie is a Leicester Square Theatre New Act 
 of the Year 2025 finalist. 'Memorable and sharply written' (Tim Harding\, C
 hortle.co.uk). Jude is a So You Think You’re Funny 2025 semi-finalist. If
  you like absurd comedy this is the show for you.\nMore info: https://comed
 yatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/wood-and-crook-wooden-crook-25498/
